// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Home-cell reader — the bearer/CLI path.
//
// A CLI api-access bearer (aud = data API) can't authenticate entire-core's
// federated repos index (that needs a browser session's login JWT), so the
// bearer path can't fan out cross-jurisdiction. Instead it resolves and reads
// against the caller's HOME cell via proxyEntireApiHome (which accepts either a
// session or a bearer as the identity-exchange subject and routes to the home
// jurisdiction). This covers the common CLI case — a caller homed in the region
// their repos live in — and cleanly atomic-fails (repo not in the home listing)
// for the cross-jurisdiction case, which is deferred with the rest of the
// residency work.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

